{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"agent_message","text":"The descriptor predicate is valid for all three current v2 handle implementations. But the “safe to ship” guarantee fails for some numbers that `number?` accepts and the v2 codec rejects. The discovery summary also groups together different concerns: diagnostic summaries, recent-history retention, pretty-printing, and host-event projection. The proposed API cannot replace all of them without changing behavior.\n"}}
